{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>And I said to you.</b> By the mission of the Omnipresent: <b>Send forth My son</b>." "<b>Behold, I am slaying, etc.</b> It is the last plague, and with it He warned him first, because it is severe. And this is what is said: ״הֶן אֵל יַשְׂגִּיב בְּכֹחוֹ״ — therefore ״מִי כָמֹהוּ מוֹרֶה״ (Job 36). Flesh and blood who seeks to take vengeance on his fellow conceals his intentions, so that he not seek rescue; but the Holy One, blessed be He, prevails in His strength, and there is no escaping His hand except by returning to Him — therefore He instructs him and warns him to return."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:50:33.217398869Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}